---
import SlideLayout from '../../../layouts/SlideLayout.astro';
---
<SlideLayout
  title="Slide 14 - Podsumowanie — C4 Container Level"
  bgImage="/images/background-2.jpg"
  bgOverlay="linear-gradient(rgba(10,14,23,0.78), rgba(10,14,23,0.9))"
>
  <div class="content">
    <div class="header">
      <span class="eyebrow"><i class="ti ti-vocabulary"></i>Container · Level 2</span>
      <h1 class="title">
        Podsumowanie
      </h1>
    </div>

    <div class="grid">
      <article class="takeaway" style="--delay: 0.35s;">
        <div class="t-icon"><i class="ti ti-stack-2"></i></div>
        <div class="t-copy">
          <h3>Co pokazuje</h3>
          <p>Aplikacje, bazy, kolejki, procesy, integracje — klocki, z których zbudowany jest system.</p>
        </div>
      </article>

      <article class="takeaway" style="--delay: 0.5s;">
        <div class="t-icon"><i class="ti ti-list-details"></i></div>
        <div class="t-copy">
          <h3>Każdy element</h3>
          <p><strong>Nazwa</strong> + <strong>technologia</strong> + <strong>odpowiedzialność</strong> — bez tego diagram jest tylko szkicem.</p>
        </div>
      </article>

      <article class="takeaway" style="--delay: 0.65s;">
        <div class="t-icon"><i class="ti ti-route"></i></div>
        <div class="t-copy">
          <h3>Relacje</h3>
          <p><strong>Kto</strong> → <strong>z kim</strong> → <strong>czym</strong> → <strong>w jakim kierunku</strong>. Każda strzałka opisana.</p>
        </div>
      </article>

      <article class="takeaway" style="--delay: 0.8s;">
        <div class="t-icon"><i class="ti ti-fence"></i></div>
        <div class="t-copy">
          <h3>Granica systemu</h3>
          <p>Jasne rozróżnienie <strong>nasze</strong> vs. <strong>zewnętrzne</strong> — inny kolor, inna ramka.</p>
        </div>
      </article>
    </div>

    <aside class="closing">
      <div class="closing-mark"><i class="ti ti-target-arrow"></i></div>
      <p>
        Dobry diagram kontenerów pokazuje <strong>uruchamialne części systemu</strong>
        i decyzje, które realnie pomagają zespołowi projektować, rozwijać i rozmawiać.
      </p>
    </aside>

  </div>
</SlideLayout>

<style is:global>
  .stage {
    justify-content: flex-start;
  }

  .content {
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 1660px;
    padding: 48px 3rem 0;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .header {
    margin-bottom: 30px;
    opacity: 0;
    animation: fadeUp 0.8s ease-out 0.15s forwards;
  }

  .eyebrow {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 10px;
    padding: 7px 18px;
    border-radius: 999px;
    background: rgba(34, 211, 238, 0.1);
    border: 1px solid rgba(34, 211, 238, 0.35);
    color: var(--cyan-400);
    font-size: 15px;
    font-weight: 600;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 3px;
    margin-bottom: 18px;
  }

  .eyebrow i { font-size: 18px; }

  .title {
    font-size: 68px;
    font-weight: 800;
    line-height: 1.05;
    margin: 0;
    color: #f8fafc;
  }

  .grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
    gap: 20px;
    width: 100%;
    margin-bottom: 28px;
  }

  .takeaway {
    position: relative;
    min-height: 178px;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 68px 1fr;
    align-items: start;
    gap: 22px;
    padding: 28px 30px;
    background:
      linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(34, 211, 238, 0.1), rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.28)),
      rgba(17, 24, 39, 0.66);
    backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
    border: 1px solid rgba(148, 163, 184, 0.24);
    border-radius: 18px;
    text-align: left;
    opacity: 0;
    transform: translateY(20px);
    animation: fadeUp 0.85s ease-out forwards;
    animation-delay: var(--delay, 0.4s);
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .t-icon {
    width: 64px;
    height: 64px;
    border-radius: 16px;
    background: rgba(34, 211, 238, 0.12);
    border: 1px solid rgba(34, 211, 238, 0.42);
    color: var(--cyan-400);
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    font-size: 32px;
    box-shadow: 0 16px 36px rgba(8, 145, 178, 0.14);
  }

  .takeaway h3 {
    margin: 0 0 8px;
    font-size: 28px;
    font-weight: 800;
    color: #f1f5f9;
    line-height: 1.15;
  }

  .takeaway p {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: 20px;
    font-weight: 300;
    line-height: 1.45;
    color: #cbd5e1;
  }

  .takeaway p strong {
    font-weight: 700;
    color: #f8fafc;
  }

  .closing {
    width: 100%;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 74px 1fr;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 24px;
    padding: 24px 34px;
    background:
      linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(34, 211, 238, 0.12), rgba(20, 184, 166, 0.08)),
      rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.72);
    border: 1px solid rgba(34, 211, 238, 0.42);
    border-radius: 20px;
    box-shadow: 0 20px 54px rgba(2, 6, 23, 0.28);
    text-align: left;
    opacity: 0;
    transform: translateY(20px);
    animation: fadeUp 0.9s ease-out 1s forwards;
  }

  .closing-mark {
    width: 74px;
    height: 74px;
    border-radius: 18px;
    background: rgba(34, 211, 238, 0.14);
    border: 1px solid rgba(34, 211, 238, 0.45);
    color: var(--cyan-400);
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    font-size: 40px;
  }

  .closing p {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: 29px;
    font-weight: 300;
    line-height: 1.35;
    color: #e2e8f0;
  }

  .closing p strong {
    color: #f8fafc;
    font-weight: 800;
  }
</style>
